\pard\ltrpar\pard\ltrpar\s1\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\outlinelevel9\sb0\sa0\sbauto0\saauto0\nowidctlpar\sl0\hyphpar1\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1033\ltrch\dbch\af10\afs24\alang1033\hich\af10\afs24\alang1033\loch\f10\fs24\cf0\nosupersub\charscalex100
\expndtw0\b0\scaps0\ulnone\ulc0\striked0\i0\kerning1\strike0\v0\caps0\lang1033\chcbpat0\highlight0 The steps to accomplish the goals of this project are:\par
{\listtext\pard\plain\b0\i0\kerning1\scaps0\caps0\strike0\ul0\cf0\f19\fs12?\f19\tab}\pard\s1\ls1\ilvl0\ql\li360\ri0\fi-360\outlinelevel9\sb0\sa0\sbauto0\saauto0\nowidctlpar\sl0\hyphpar1\rtlch\af10\afs24\alang1033\ltrch\dbch
\af10\afs24\alang1033\hich\af10\afs24\alang1033\loch\f10\fs24\cf0\nosupersub\charscalex100\expndtw0\b0\scaps0\ulnone\ulc0\striked0\i0\kerning1\strike0\v0\caps0\lang1033\chcbpat0\highlight0 Survey existing commercial MES\u8217\'92
s and their capabilities to distill a list of required functionality and document the conclusions.\par
{\listtext\pard\plain\b0\i0\kerning1\scaps0\caps0\strike0\ul0\cf0\f19\fs12?\f19\tab}Propose an implementation architecture.  The system should be client/server with a REST HTTP/HTTPS interface between clients and a server
.  The clients can be written in the programming language of the end user\u8217\'92s choice.  A runtime client that manipulates WIP can have a GUI for use by a human or can be headless if interfacing to automated equipmen
t for example.  A design time client will allow the end user to view what funtionality has been implemented and how the pieces \u8220\'93fit together\u8221\'94.  The server will provide MES capabilities and store data in 
a Relational Database Management System (RDBMS) for tracking and reporting purposes.\par
{\listtext\pard\plain\b0\i0\kerning1\scaps0\caps0\strike0\ul0\cf0\f19\fs12?\f19\tab}Divide up the implementation into a series of implementation tasks starting with the server. Automated testing needs to be implemented to
 verify that a task has been complemented.  For the physical environment of an ERP, PLCs or test equipment, it is not feasible to test agains \u8220\'93real\u8221\'94 interfaces or devices.  In this case, mocking up an in
terface will be required.\par
